  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Captions Toggle\r\n\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Add `let captionsOn = false;` at the top of your JS.\r\n2. Write a `render()` function that:\r\n\r\n   * Shows the captions line when `captionsOn` is true.\r\n   * Hides the captions line when `captionsOn` is false.\r\n3. In your button click event: flip `captionsOn` and call `render()`.\r\n\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
